// The AI in a money deadlock (WP9.1b-2, docs/rules/ai.md, "The rescue"): player 0 (Meridian) is the AI with a
// construction centre and 6000 credits on the first match's map (`assets/maps/m1`, rich ore as in `ai_economy`);
// player 1 (Veyran) is a lone static construction centre. Its profile (`ai_deadlock_defs/normal.ron`, a frozen
// copy of the one of `ai_base_defs`) has a goal list of five: power plant, refinery, barracks, vehicle factory,
// radar. The world has the repair and sale rules of `ai_rebuild` (a sale takes 100 ticks and pays 500
// thousandths of the price at the hit points the structure has then).
//
// The script, by entity id (0 the AI's centre, 1 player 1's centre, 2 the first power plant, 3 the refinery, 4
// its free harvester, 5 the barracks, 6 the second power plant, 7 the vehicle factory, 8 the radar, 9 the
// harvester the economy buys at tick 2000):
//   tick 3000   player 0 queues four light tanks (kind 19) at the vehicle factory, Id(7, 0): 2,800 credits that
//               are paid as they are built, so the credits fall to about 0 by tick 3400 and stay there (the
//               first tank is Id(10, 0))
//   tick 3601   Despawn Id(3, 0), Id(4, 0), Id(9, 0): the refinery and both harvesters are lost with the
//               credits at 2. The goal list wants the refinery (an unfunded emergency, ordered at tick 3610) and
//               nothing pays for it: a deadlock. The economy turn sees it stalled at ticks 3640 and 3680 and,
//               with no harvester and no dock, sells the barracks, the radar and the vehicle factory at
//               tick 3680 (refunds 200, 450 and 750: no one of them covers the 1,200 owed, the three do).
//   tick 8601   Despawn Id(9, 1), Id(8, 1): the rebuilt refinery and its free harvester (the slots of the sold
//               radar and of the first refinery, one generation later) are lost again with 1,002 credits. The
//               rescue is spent: the AI orders the refinery again (tick 8610), pays what it has and waits for
//               the end of the run, selling nothing.
// `unit_defs` names the FROZEN copy `ai_deadlock_defs`.
Scenario(
    name: "ai_deadlock",
    seed: 0xA1_BA5E,
    map: (width: 96, height: 96),
    map_name: Some("m1"),
    unit_defs: Some("ai_deadlock_defs"),
    match_file: Some("match.ron"),
    ai: [(player: 0, profile: "normal.ron", seed: 0xA1_0001)],
    buildings: true,
    combat: true,
    targeting: true,
    destruction: true,
    ore: Some((start: 160, max: 160, regrow_amount: 8, regrow_period: 40)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
        call_timeout: 10,
        max_tries: 3,
        park_distance: 4,
        park_spread: 5,
        park_near_tenths: 20,
        mine_start_tenths: 10,
        mine_reach_tenths: 15,
        mine_lose_tenths: 25,
        dock_reach_tenths: 20,
        travel_cost: 16,
        queue_cost: 100,
        switch_margin: 100,
        recheck_period: 20,
        queue_gap: 3,
        queue_start: 1,
        queue_step: 2,
        queue_rows: 8,
    )),
    storage: Some([(2, 2000), (43, 1500)]),
    money: Some((credits_per_ore: 1)),
    production: Some((queue_limit: 5, exit_radius: 4, build_speed: (3, 2))),
    power: Some((shortage_floor_permille: 250, defence_cutoff_permille: 1000)),
    repair: Some((hp_per_tick: 3, full_cost_permille: 250, sell_ticks: 100, refund_permille: 500)),
    vision: Some((legacy_sight_milli: 5000, acquire_needs_sight: true)),
    ticks: 12000,
    commands: [
        (tick: 3000, player: 0, command: QueueUnit(factory: (7, 0), kind: 19)),
        (tick: 3000, player: 0, command: QueueUnit(factory: (7, 0), kind: 19)),
        (tick: 3000, player: 0, command: QueueUnit(factory: (7, 0), kind: 19)),
        (tick: 3000, player: 0, command: QueueUnit(factory: (7, 0), kind: 19)),
        (tick: 3601, player: 1, command: Despawn(ids: [Id(3, 0), Id(4, 0), Id(9, 0)])),
        (tick: 8601, player: 1, command: Despawn(ids: [Id(9, 1), Id(8, 1)])),
    ],
)
